<%# locals: (error:) %>
<%#
  One per-document problem in the Weird Stuff column, already formatted as
  "RAD-42 - missing access date". The icon carries the meaning alongside the
  colour. Shared with the legend so the two cannot drift apart.
%>
<span class="text-error font-semibold">
  <%= fa_icon "circle-exclamation", :solid, end: 1 %><%= error %>
</span>
